# Erawood Fabrication Static Site

This repository contains a fully static, bilingual landing page and admin console for Erawood Fabrication. All assets are lightweight SVGs so the project can be hosted directly from object storage without a build step.

## Quick start
1. Serve the root directory with any static file server. For example:
   ```bash
   python -m http.server 8080
   ```
   > ℹ️ Port 8000 is avoided because some environments reserve it; feel free to substitute any other open port.
2. Open `http://localhost:8080/` in a modern browser.
3. Press <kbd>F12</kbd> to reveal the admin login modal (password: `123`).

## Data model
- `data/site.json` is the single source of truth for site copy, product definitions, categories, and parameter types.
- Runtime updates are cached in `localStorage` until exported or reset.

## Project layout
```
index.html        # Public landing page entry point
admin.html        # Admin surface rendered after login
css/styles.css    # Global styles and component tokens
js/router.js      # Hash-based navigation helpers
js/store.js       # Data layer, persistence, and language state
js/gallery.js     # Product grid, filtering, and lightbox logic
js/admin.js       # Admin console modules (CRUD, import/export)
data/site.json    # Seed content and configuration
assets/           # SVG imagery used across the site
robots.txt        # SEO directives
sitemap.xml       # Static sitemap for search engines
```

## Development notes
- No external dependencies or build tooling are required.
- Keep the combined JavaScript payload below 200 KB to satisfy the performance budget.
- All file paths must remain relative so the site deploys cleanly to static hosting.
